WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
How many kilograms are here?

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,280
How could I know

3
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,840
Don't you have a scale inside? Go and weigh it.

4
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:11,950
Then come in and weigh it. You see.

5
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:13,230
More than 1,500 kilograms

6
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:15,190
Just give me more than 1,500 yuan.

7
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:24,070
Can I try it? Yes, you can try the ice machine.

8
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:25,610
What kind of ice machine is this?

9
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,690
What do you think this thing is used for?

10
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:28,650
young people

11
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:29,930
Are you kidding me here?

12
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:31,450
What is this thing used for?

13
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,370
This thing is used to build a house

14
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:34,890
Look at this tall building

15
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,810
How could it be built without Rowan Gang?

16
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,210
it is bearable

17
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:39,250
Do you understand?

18
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:40,450
do you want

19
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:42,290
No, just stop talking nonsense to me here.

20
00:00:42,290 --> 00:00:45,530
How can I have time to spend time with you here making a mess for me to buy?

21
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:46,790
I want them all

22
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:48,110
Are you so talkative?

23
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,510
One thousand five hundred and sixty-eight yuan

24
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:50,550
Give it to me right away
